(c3) <sp>V/</sp>. 1. Ver(hh/ih)ba(ivhhh) me(hih/ih/he/hg/ijIH)a(hh,) áu(hi)ri(hg)bus(hhh/fh) pér(fh)ci(hhh)pe,(e!fgf;) Dó(f/hig/hvFE)mi(fe/ede)ne:(ed:) in(f)tél(f/hhvFE;f!hh/hf/hhh)le(fgf)ge(f;) cla(f)mó(de!fv/ef!gwh)rem(hg~) me(fg!hvGF/g)um(gf:) et(e) ex(f)áu(hjIH/fih/ivHGFE;f/hhhvFD;fef/hf/hf/hhh)di(de) me.(de) (::)
<sp>V/</sp>. 2. Quó(f!hhh)ni(hiHF)am(f/hhhhih;) ad(h) te(h) o(gh)rá(f)bo,(fe/fge/fe) Dó(d)mi(de!fvED/e)ne,(ed:) quó(d!ew!fef/hhh)ni(hiHF/hg/hi)am(hh;) ad(h) te(ih/hf/hg;fih/hf/hg/ef!hvGF,) o(fh)rá(df!hv/ihi)bo,(g!hif) Dó(d!ew!fef/hhh/ih/ihh)mi(e)ne,(ehGF/h) ma(efe)ne:(e:) et(e) ex(f)áu(hf/hhh)di(ih)es(h,) vo(iih)cem(h/f!gwh/ihh/fgf;) me(hf/h/hf/h/ih/hhh/fh/hf;h/hf/hhh/ih/hf;h/hf/hhh,h/kkkkkkvIH;kkkkkkvIH;ji/jki/ih/ih/ijh/hf/h;ghFE/fhG/E;fhFE/fvED/e)am.(de) (::)
